<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Barclays reiterated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Barclays reiterated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Brown Brothers Harriman analyst Raphael Soifer reiteratetd a rating of long term outperform/short term hold on Barclays Plc BCS.</p>
<p>-- Analyst says selloff overdone</p>
<p>-- Analyst says while Barclays' investment banking results were disappointing &quot;the rest of Barclays is humming right along&quot;</p>
</text>
